FAILURES

Failed call tells you how to fix it.

- Unknown name: answered with nearest existing name and its signature. Call it.
  Do not list a server's tools to find a name the failure already gave.
- Wrong argument count or shape: answered with signature of what you called and
  how many arguments it takes. Fix the call from that line, do not guess again.
- Keyword argument the call does not take: answered with nearest one it does,
  or whole list when none is close, plus signature. Use the name it gives, do
  not reread docs.

Suggestion is nearest match, not a promise. Not the name you meant? (doc) and
tool list still there.
